                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bakaamba bati, Ino nduliyonzi ndutweelede kubweedezya antoomwe andilyo? Nkabela bakaamba bati, Zyuute zyosanwe zyangolida ambeba zyosanwe zyangolida, mbuli mweelwe wabami baba-Filisti, nkaambo kakuti bulwazi bomwe bwakamusikila nyoonse abami banu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.4",
