        },
        {
          "text": "Ino nkaambonzi mulalemya myoyo yanu mbuli ba-Egepita a-Farao mbubakalemya myoyo yabo? Naakamana kubasabula, teebakabatuma kuti bainke na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
