        },
        {
          "text": "Lino zyuute zyangolida nzibakabweedezya ba-Filisti mbuli luliyo lwaJehova zyakali boobu, cimwi cakali ca-Asidodi, cimwi cakali ca-Gaza, cimwi cakali ca-Asikeloni, cimwi cakali ca-Gati, cimwi cakali ca-Ekroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
