              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azyalo imbeba zyangolida zyakali mbuli mweelwe wamyunzi yoonse yaba-Filisri yabami bosanwe, niiba myunzi iizyungulusizidwe imbaya niiba myunzi iitakwe imbaya kusikila kubbwe ipati mpobakatula ibbokesi lya-Jehova alindilyo, Ibbwe elyo liciliko asunu mumuunda wa-Joshua muna-Betisemesi.",
          "type": "text",
